<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Sour</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Yours Truly</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">TOXIC</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4qiBJ5ayrnaDjmNW4U97E1</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Steve Knight"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Samuel Bassal"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Mikaila Delgado"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Mikaila Delgado"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Still got my cheek between my teeth</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If I bite I’ll taste my blood it’s sweet</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don’t wanna feel at ease</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So I hang over the street</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You wanna be a listener?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really hear you but have you ever thought of closing your mouth?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Still got my tongue between your teeth</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If you bite you’ll taste my blood for free</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You want another part of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Which one do I get to keep?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Chew me up and spit me out</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like the taste I’m going</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sour</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sour</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You want another part of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Which one do I get to keep?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Chew me up and spit me out</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like the taste I’m going</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sour</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sour</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Skin dug under my fingernail</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If I pull I’ll tear my skin to hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I can’t coz if I do</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You can’t replace me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Do you wanna me a listener</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Coz i really hear you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But have you ever thought that I don’t really care?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Still got my tongue between your teeth</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If you bite you’ll taste my blood for free</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You want another part of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Which one do I get to keep?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Chew me up and spit me out</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like the taste I’m going</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You want another part of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Which one do I get to keep?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Chew me up and spit me out</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like the taste I’m going</p><p ttm:agent="v1">These days I’m not having any fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Straight to my face like a loaded gun</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Rolling my eyes I’m already gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like the taste I’m going</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sour</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sour</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You wanna be a listener?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really hear you but have you ever thought of closing your mouth?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wanna be a listener?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really hear</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You wanna be a listener?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really hear you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You want another part of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Which one do I get to keep?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Chew me up and spit me out</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like the taste I’m going</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You want another part of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Which one do I get to keep?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Chew me up and spit me out</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like the taste I’m going</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wanna be a listener?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really hear</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You wanna be a listener?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really hear you</p></div></body></tt>